WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/components/data-display/DateGroupedList.tsx — a GENERIC, PURELY PRESENTATIONAL container (113 L). It is
  handed `groups: readonly DateGroupedListGroup<T>[]` plus a `renderItem(item, indexInGroup)` render prop and an
  optional `itemKey(item, idx)` stable-key extractor. Each group carries:
    • dateKey       — sortable `YYYY-MM-DD` key, used as the React key.
    • dateLabel     — pre-formatted visible label ("May 9, 2026"); `font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]`.
    • relativeLabel — optional muted secondary ("3 days ago"); rendered "· {relative}" `text-[var(--text-muted)]`.
    • summary       — optional ReactNode, right-aligned in the divider row ("2 drives · 6.2 mi"),
                      `text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] tabular-nums`.
    • items         — the rows.
  Render per group: a `<section aria-labelledby>` → a `<header class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3">` with the
  label block, a `flex-1 h-px bg-[var(--glass-border)] opacity-50` rule, and the optional summary; then the items
  at `space-y-3`, groups separated by `space-y-6`. Per-item key is `itemKey ? itemKey(item, idx) : idx`.
  Data sources: NONE (pure presentational; no hooks). i18n: NONE — the surface is ANONYMOUS (zero `t()` calls;
  every visible string is pre-formatted by the caller). Domain aggregation ("2 drives · 6.2 mi") lives on the
  caller so the component stays free of unit/format logic.

